cid='c0082';d=deepcopy(D['decisions'][cid]);desc='''National arsenals and factories are moved to the Moon to evolve independently. The selected unit is an autonomous military production ecology rather than a resident civilian person community receiving its output. The temporary investigator from Earth does not become a permanent lunar welfare population. The mechanism receives a completed comparison instead of a continuing lore-gap hold.

 Secure human support is extremely weak by analogy, and control is decisively autonomous machinery. The nonworking axis is inapplicable to this selected weapons-ecology unit because it has no identified active civilian recipient population; equipment and externally visiting humans are not leisure citizens. This does not assert that artificial consciousness is impossible, only that autonomous weapon evolution is not itself a civilian person census. The case stays outside the society count for its military-ecology scope. Explosive growth, dead opponents and discarded hardware are never used to infer one hundred percent freedom from work.'''
ca=dict(name='Peace on Earth (the lunar weapons ecology)',media=['book'],scope='Autonomous lunar arsenals and factories; temporary investigator excluded',axis=dict(guarantees=.98,control=-1,nonworking=None),intervals=dict(guarantees=[.8,1],control=[-1,-.9],nonworking=None),confidence='low',canon_facts=['National arsenals and factories move to the Moon to evolve independently; an investigator visits from Earth.'],editorial_assumptions=['The selected weapons ecology is not a resident civilian recipient institution.','Autonomous machinery is not automatically a population of conscious nonworkers.'],not_applicable_axes={'nonworking':'No active civilian person recipient cohort in the selected weapons-ecology unit; equipment and a temporary investigator are not a leisure population.'},source_ids=d['source_ids'],counted_toward_goal=False)
d.update(status='boundary_case',current_policy_review=True,reassessed_on=DATE,assessment_mode='best_guess',reason='Completed autonomous-weapons-ecology comparison; civilian person participation is inapplicable to the selected unit.',analysis=desc,comparison_assessment=ca,follow_up='Completed current-policy mechanism comparison; no deep reading required.');changes.append(change(D,'decisions',d))
